DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
40898::$$$message_0275_0000_0000$$$::I made a promise to go to the pool with Tohsaka.[lr]::
40899::$$$message_0275_0000_0001$$$::The objective was to see her in a swimsuit rather than to go swimming, but it doesn't change the fact that we're going to the pool.[lr]::
40900::$$$message_0275_0000_0002$$$::The weather is good, so I'll try inviting her.::
40901::$$$message_0275_0001_0000$$$::"Tohsaka, do you have a minute?"[lr]::
40902::$$$message_0275_0001_0001$$$::"Emiya? Sure."::
40903::$$$message_0275_0002_0000$$$::Tohsaka is in her usual cluttered room.[lr]::
40904::$$$message_0275_0002_0001$$$::...It's not the right mood to bring it up out of the blue, but it's better to be straightforward with Tohsaka.[lr]::
40905::$$$message_0275_0002_0002$$$::If I talk about it in a roundabout way, she might make unreasonable demands again.::
40906::$$$message_0275_0003_0000$$$::"I came for one reason.[lr]::
40907::$$$message_0275_0003_0001$$$::...Tohsaka, do you remember our promise about the pool?"[lr]::
40908::$$$message_0275_0003_0002$$$::"Hm? About Waku Waku Zabuun in Shinto? [cacheimage storage=凛私服09e(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg storage=凛私服09e(中) time=300 textoff=0]Oh..."::
40909::$$$message_0275_0004_0000$$$::She's speechless for about five seconds.[lr]::
40910::$$$message_0275_0004_0001$$$::Tohsaka, who remembered our promise, seems to be ruminating about the conversation where many things happened.::
40911::$$$message_0275_0005_0000$$$::"I-I see.[lr]::
40912::$$$message_0275_0005_0001$$$::...Since you chose to come and ask me, does that mean you're prepared, Emiya?"[lr]::
40913::$$$message_0275_0005_0002$$$::"Prepared, huh? Well, yeah, to a certain degree."[lr]::
40914::$$$message_0275_0005_0003$$$::Given that we're talking about those kinds of things, I can't just face going to the pool with half-hearted resolve.[lr]::
40915::$$$message_0275_0005_0004$$$::I'm going to see Tohsaka in a swimsuit, so I'm mentally prepared enough.::
40916::$$$message_0275_0006_0000$$$::"...I hope so.[lr]::
40917::$$$message_0275_0006_0001$$$::Do you even have a swimsuit, Emiya? I wouldn't want to go with someone who's wearing a school-designated competition swimsuit."[lr]::
40918::$$$message_0275_0006_0002$$$::"Of course I have one prepared. Yours also isn't our school's, right?"::
40919::$$$message_0275_0007_0000$$$::"Would you be unsatisfied?"[lr]::
40920::$$$message_0275_0007_0001$$$::"Well, I think you'd end up more unsatisfied than me. Or at the very least, you'd make it difficult on me..."::
40921::$$$message_0275_0008_0000$$$::Our school-designated competition swimsuit has no sense of playfulness.[lr]::
40922::$$$message_0275_0008_0001$$$::Well, it's good in its own way like how it shows the body's lines, but the water park should be a festival of colorful swimsuits. No, that's why a navy swimsuit would look good in a place like that. Simple is best. Is it like the beauty of a flower in the wild...!?::
40923::$$$message_0275_0009_0000$$$::"...I see.[lr]::
40924::$$$message_0275_0009_0001$$$::If that's the case, then...I don't...mind."[lr]::
40925::$$$message_0275_0009_0002$$$::Tohsaka is saying it's fine, so a competition swimsuit wouldn't be bad either.::
40926::$$$message_0275_0010_0000$$$::"...Sorry. I was just kidding.[lr]::
40927::$$$message_0275_0010_0001$$$::What's wrong, Emiya? You would usually panic telling me to stop, but you're being weirdly open-minded.[lr]::
40928::$$$message_0275_0010_0002$$$::Well, you've been acting weird. Really weird. You seem like you're calm, but you're not."::
40929::$$$message_0275_0011_0000$$$::"Mrgh..."[lr]::
40930::$$$message_0275_0011_0001$$$::...That might be true.[lr]::
40931::$$$message_0275_0011_0002$$$::I'm going to the pool with Tohsaka.[lr]::
40932::$$$message_0275_0011_0003$$$::Just because I'm mentally prepared doesn't mean my nerves will go away, and just as we're talking about this, I'm...::
40933::$$$message_0275_0012_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
40934::$$$message_0275_0012_0001$$$::Dammit, I'm getting even more nervous.[lr]::
40935::$$$message_0275_0012_0002$$$::Calm down.[lr]::
40936::$$$message_0275_0012_0003$$$::We're just going to the indoor pool in our city; it's not like we're gonna go kill each other...!::
40937::$$$message_0275_0013_0000$$$::"...All right, I finally calmed down somehow.[lr]::
40938::$$$message_0275_0013_0001$$$::So we both have our swimsuits prepared, right?[lr]::
40939::$$$message_0275_0013_0002$$$::Then we don't have any time to waste. Let's go to the pool today. Show me your swimsuit as promised, Tohsaka."[lr]::
40940::$$$message_0275_0013_0003$$$::I suggest again.[lr]::
40941::$$$message_0275_0013_0004$$$::For some reason, Tohsaka gulps.::
40942::$$$message_0275_0014_0000$$$::"All right, sure. It would be a disgrace to the Tohsaka name if I didn't respond to the challenge.[lr]::
40943::$$$message_0275_0014_0001$$$::But..."[lr]::
40944::$$$message_0275_0014_0002$$$::"But, what?"::
40945::$$$message_0275_0015_0000$$$::"Do you remember what I was saying?[lr]::
40946::$$$message_0275_0015_0001$$$::This date is a fair exchange. In exchange for me wearing my swimsuit, you have to do what I say.[lr]::
40947::$$$message_0275_0015_0002$$$::D-do you still want to see my swimsuit even then?"::
40948::$$$message_0275_0016_0000$$$::"I said I want to see. I came to invite you. I'm prepared."[lr]::
40949::$$$message_0275_0016_0001$$$::First of all, Tohsaka's the one who asked me if I'm prepared first.[lr]::
40950::$$$message_0275_0016_0002$$$::"I-I know, I was just checking![lr]::
40951::$$$message_0275_0016_0003$$$::...Fine, since we did promise. Oh, I won't listen no matter how much you regret it later!"::
40952::$$$message_0275_0017_0000$$$::And then I'm chased away from her room.[lr]::
40953::$$$message_0275_0017_0001$$$::Tohsaka has to get ready, so we decide to meet at the door in thirty minutes.[lr]::
40954::$$$message_0275_0017_0002$$$::Thus, we put our promise from that day into action.[lr]::
40955::$$$message_0275_0017_0003$$$::...God knows what may happen.::
40956::$$$message_0275_0018_0000$$$::"We're heading out. Look after the house for me."[lr]::
40957::$$$message_0275_0018_0001$$$::"Look forward to the souvenirs, everyone."[lr]::
40958::$$$message_0275_0018_0002$$$::"Well, we're only going to Shinto, so won't it be hard to get any fancy souvenirs?"[lr]::
40959::$$$message_0275_0018_0003$$$::"I'm kidding. I just wanted to set the mood."::
40960::$$$message_0275_0019_0000$$$::...So.[lr]::
40961::$$$message_0275_0019_0001$$$::We were energetic when we left, but we start to lose words as we start to be aware of each other more and more.[lr]::
40962::$$$message_0275_0019_0002$$$::It was within my expectations, but I'm surprised that Tohsaka has gotten quiet too.::
40963::$$$message_0275_0020_0000$$$::"L-let's go then.[lr]::
40964::$$$message_0275_0020_0001$$$::Oh, I have a ticket that I received as a gift."[lr]::
40965::$$$message_0275_0020_0002$$$::"Oh, really? [cacheimage storage=凛私服08b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=凛私服08b(中)]W-what a steal."[lr]::
40966::$$$message_0275_0020_0003$$$::It's this.[lr]::
40967::$$$message_0275_0020_0004$$$::Tohsaka is also oddly meek, which is making me go crazy.::
40968::$$$message_0275_0021_0000$$$::"...Mrgh. We can see Waku Waku Zabuun now.[lr]::
40969::$$$message_0275_0021_0001$$$::...How pathetic of me to start worrying about it now..."[lr]::
40970::$$$message_0275_0021_0002$$$::"Huh? Did you say something, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
40971::$$$message_0275_0021_0003$$$::"N-not really. It's my first time, so I was hoping it's fun.[lr]::
40972::$$$message_0275_0021_0004$$$::Y-you seem to be excited."[lr]::
40973::$$$message_0275_0021_0005$$$::Is she not interested at all?[lr]::
40974::$$$message_0275_0021_0006$$$::But, after glaring at Waku Waku Zabuun, she deliberately shouts out to me in high spirits.::
40975::$$$message_0275_0022_0000$$$::"All right, let's go![lr]::
40976::$$$message_0275_0022_0001$$$::Shirou, are you ready!?"[lr]::
40977::$$$message_0275_0022_0002$$$::"Yeah. I said I was from the start."[lr]::
40978::$$$message_0275_0022_0003$$$::"Oof... L-let's go, then![lr]::
40979::$$$message_0275_0022_0004$$$::Once we get changed, just you wait and see!"::
40980::$$$message_0275_0023_0000$$$::Tohsaka marches towards Waku Waku Zabuun.[lr]::
40981::$$$message_0275_0023_0001$$$::That bravery is like a tank or an armored car.[lr]::
40982::$$$message_0275_0023_0002$$$::I can only follow behind like a combat medic.::
40983::$$$message_0275_0024_0000$$$::"I'll see you in fifteen minutes! At the poolside!"[lr]::
40984::$$$message_0275_0024_0001$$$::I part with Tohsaka in front of the locker rooms, change quickly, and go through the gate after checking myself in the mirror once.[lr]::
40985::$$$message_0275_0024_0002$$$::In the midst of peaceful early autumn, when one wouldn't desire the hot sun rays of August... ::
40986::$$$message_0275_0025_0000$$$::"Woah...!"[lr]::
40987::$$$message_0275_0025_0001$$$::The sun rays, which are strong enough to make one want to close their eyes, await the many couples...!::
40988::$$$message_0275_0026_0000$$$::"Wow. They really made something like this."[lr]::
40989::$$$message_0275_0026_0001$$$::The artificial sunlight that recreates summer.[lr]::
40990::$$$message_0275_0026_0002$$$::Blue sparkles as far as the eye can see.[lr]::
40991::$$$message_0275_0026_0003$$$::I thought it was fishy when I saw the ad, but now I'm genuinely happy.::
40992::$$$message_0275_0027_0000$$$::"Okay. I see why people come in October now."[lr]::
40993::$$$message_0275_0027_0001$$$::At any rate, this dome is an eternal summer.[lr]::
40994::$$$message_0275_0027_0002$$$::If they can recreate a summer water park this brilliantly, it would make sense why people would want to visit to remember summer.::
40995::$$$message_0275_0028_0000$$$::"...All right."[lr]::
40996::$$$message_0275_0028_0001$$$::I wait for Tohsaka in a beach chair that I pulled over here.[lr]::
40997::$$$message_0275_0028_0002$$$::Compared to guys changing, girls take a lot of time.::
40998::$$$message_0275_0029_0000$$$::   Tohsaka's swimsuit, huh?[lr]::
40999::$$$message_0275_0029_0001$$$::I'm also super excited, but now, I wonder what kind of conditions she'll present to me in exchange.::
41000::$$$message_0275_0030_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
41001::$$$message_0275_0030_0001$$$::I can't let my guard down. Tohsaka is well experienced in troubling me and having fun.[lr]::
41002::$$$message_0275_0030_0002$$$::Whatever.[lr]::
41003::$$$message_0275_0030_0003$$$::I won't think about it too much and just wait for Tohsaka.::
41004::$$$message_0275_0031_0000$$$::If Tohsaka comes, it will cause a stir among the other customers with those looks and that figure of hers.[lr]::
41005::$$$message_0275_0031_0001$$$::That'll let me know that she's coming, so there's no way I'll be caught off guar[line len=2][lr]::
41006::$$$message_0275_0031_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
41007::$$$message_0275_0031_0003$$$::...Just now...I feel like I saw something like a good luck charm in the corner of my eye.::
41008::$$$message_0275_0032_0000$$$::"...Right?"[lr]::
41009::$$$message_0275_0032_0001$$$::I wasn't seeing things.[lr]::
41010::$$$message_0275_0032_0002$$$::I see Tohsaka, dressed in white and glittering in the distance.[lr]::
41011::$$$message_0275_0032_0003$$$::Her outfit is too strange to be called a swimsuit.::
41012::$$$message_0275_0033_0000$$$::"Hey, Tohsaka... Wait, [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=500 count=-3]don't run away!"[lr]::
41013::$$$message_0275_0033_0001$$$::When I stop her, she comes over to me reluctantly.[wm canskip=0]::
41014::$$$message_0275_0034_0000$$$::"D-don't raise your voice too much, what if there are people we know?"[lr]::
41015::$$$message_0275_0034_0001$$$::"Why are you worried about that now? You can tell right away from a distance.[lr]::
41016::$$$message_0275_0034_0002$$$::So, what is that?"::
41017::$$$message_0275_0035_0000$$$::Tohsaka is covering her body with a white bath towel in front of me.[lr]::
41018::$$$message_0275_0035_0001$$$::It's just like a poncho.[lr]::
41019::$$$message_0275_0035_0002$$$::Could it be possible that this is Tohsaka's swimsuit...?::
41020::$$$message_0275_0036_0000$$$::"...C-can't you tell just by looking?"[lr]::
41021::$$$message_0275_0036_0001$$$::"I can tell. That's my bath towel."[lr]::
41022::$$$message_0275_0036_0002$$$::"Oh, well I borrowed yours."::
41023::$$$message_0275_0037_0000$$$::I knew it.[lr]::
41024::$$$message_0275_0037_0001$$$::But, I'm not trying to ask where that towel came from.[lr]::
41025::$$$message_0275_0037_0002$$$::What's more important than anything right now is what's underneath it.::
41026::$$$message_0275_0038_0000$$$::"Tohsaka. I'll have you show me your swimsuit today as promised."[lr]::
41027::$$$message_0275_0038_0001$$$::"...[wait canskip=false time=300][say storage=ctyex14_rin_0200 name=凛][chgfg time=200 storage=凛fd特殊02c(遠) textoff=0]That's also my plan.[lr]::
41028::$$$message_0275_0038_0002$$$::But Shirou. Let's both be fair."::
41029::$$$message_0275_0039_0000$$$::Fair... I don't think anything's fair about her hiding in a towel.[lr]::
41030::$$$message_0275_0039_0001$$$::It seems like there's a big gap in our values.::
41031::$$$message_0275_0040_0000$$$::"...Fair? What do you mean?"[lr]::
41032::$$$message_0275_0040_0001$$$::"W-well, if I show you my swimsuit right away, that'll mean you'll accept any conditions unconditionally.[lr]::
41033::$$$message_0275_0040_0002$$$::Y-you should have the chance to decide, too."[lr]::
41034::$$$message_0275_0040_0003$$$::"...I see. So that's what you mean."::
41035::$$$message_0275_0041_0000$$$::It must be Tohsaka's way of being kind.[lr]::
41036::$$$message_0275_0041_0001$$$::I wonder what's gotten into her all of a sudden, but this must be what you call an ultimatum.::
41037::$$$message_0275_0042_0000$$$::"...Hm. What are you going to do if I don't agree, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
41038::$$$message_0275_0042_0001$$$::"That's a matter you don't have to worry about.[lr]::
41039::$$$message_0275_0042_0002$$$::T-then, let's begin the contract. T-the condition that I have for you is..."::
41040::$$$message_0275_0043_0000$$$::I gulp and listen to what Tohsaka has to say.[lr]::
41041::$$$message_0275_0043_0001$$$::"...Obey my orders completely for the whole day."[lr]::
41042::$$$message_0275_0043_0002$$$::Phew. So, it's only that.::
41043::$$$message_0275_0044_0000$$$::"Sure. That's a piece of cake."[lr]::
41044::$$$message_0275_0044_0001$$$::"Wha... But it's absolute obedience![lr]::
41045::$$$message_0275_0044_0002$$$::Like a Servant or a maid, do you understand!?"[lr]::
41046::$$$message_0275_0044_0003$$$::"I get it. That's not too different than how things have been up to now."::
41047::$$$message_0275_0045_0000$$$::It's not an exchange condition, but I shall gladly accept it if that's the condition she's proposing.[lr]::
41048::$$$message_0275_0045_0001$$$::I thought it would be more like a crystallization of evil wisdom that would make me want to tell her not to make such an unreasonable demand.[lr]::
41049::$$$message_0275_0045_0002$$$::...Well, I'm glad that my prediction was off.::
41050::$$$message_0275_0046_0000$$$::"...C-come to think of it, you do finally get to see me in a swimsuit, so maybe I should add some twist to it."[lr]::
41051::$$$message_0275_0046_0001$$$::"No, you don't have to make it twisted.[lr]::
41052::$$$message_0275_0046_0002$$$::So, what will you do? If you want to be sure, I'll make a vow or a contract or whatever."::
41053::$$$message_0275_0047_0000$$$::"...There's no need to do that much. Once we make a promise, you won't go against it."[lr]::
41054::$$$message_0275_0047_0001$$$::She knows me well.[lr]::
41055::$$$message_0275_0047_0002$$$::This will satisfy the conditions of the fair exchange.[lr]::
41056::$$$message_0275_0047_0003$$$::In that case, it's Tohsaka's turn now.::
41057::$$$message_0275_0048_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
41058::$$$message_0275_0048_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
41059::$$$message_0275_0048_0002$$$::This is awkward.[lr]::
41060::$$$message_0275_0048_0003$$$::With just one final push, my wishes would be realized, but I can't make that one push.::
41061::$$$message_0275_0049_0000$$$::"...Hnng."[lr]::
41062::$$$message_0275_0049_0001$$$::But Tohsaka's going to get cranky at this rate.[lr]::
41063::$$$message_0275_0049_0002$$$::I don't have any real proof, but I'm certain from my intuition.[lr]::
41064::$$$message_0275_0049_0003$$$::"...Ahem."[lr]::
41065::$$$message_0275_0049_0004$$$::I clear my throat once.[lr]::
41066::$$$message_0275_0049_0005$$$::Tohsaka is being timid, which is out of character for her, so it makes me extra nervous, but nothing will happen if I don't say something.::
41067::$$$message_0275_0050_0000$$$::"T-then, the contract is complete.[lr]::
41068::$$$message_0275_0050_0001$$$::...Um, you know. I want to see you in your...swimsuit."::
41069::$$$message_0275_0051_0000$$$::I'm thirsty, as if I've swallowed dry ice.[lr]::
41070::$$$message_0275_0051_0001$$$::Wait, that would kill me.[lr]::
41071::$$$message_0275_0051_0002$$$::The waves are so unbelievably loud like it's actually the middle of summer.::
41072::$$$message_0275_0052_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=false time=400][say storage=ctyex14_rin_0280 name=凛][chgfg time=400 storage=凛fd特殊02a(中) textoff=0]Idiot."[lr]::
41073::$$$message_0275_0052_0001$$$::Then...[lr]::
41074::$$$message_0275_0052_0002$$$::A white cloth falls to the ground.::
41075::$$$message_0275_0053_0000$$$::A bright red that's blinding.[lr]::
41076::$$$message_0275_0053_0001$$$::A scarlet swimsuit that hides her smooth body.[lr]::
41077::$$$message_0275_0053_0002$$$::...It's like black tea and lemon, a bird in the sky, or salt and pepper in a frying pan.[lr]::
41078::$$$message_0275_0053_0003$$$::The swimsuit suits Rin Tohsaka, as if she was always meant to wear it.::
41079::$$$message_0275_0054_0000$$$::"........."[lr]::
41080::$$$message_0275_0054_0001$$$::...Shoot. I'm so aroused that I want to blush.[lr]::
41081::$$$message_0275_0054_0002$$$::To be honest, there were times where I suspected that my desire towards the opposite sex was lower than the average.[lr]::
41082::$$$message_0275_0054_0003$$$::But, I shall declare that that was a needless worry...!::
41083::$$$message_0275_0055_0000$$$::"...How is it? Are you satisfied, Shirou?"::
41084::$$$message_0275_0056_0000$$$::...I'm looking for a comment right now.[lr]::
41085::$$$message_0275_0056_0001$$$::I-I need to get my senses back and control my wild nature...!::
41086::$$$message_0275_0057_0000$$$::"Hey, say something."[lr]::
41087::$$$message_0275_0057_0001$$$::"Guh... Oh well, um, wait, sorry."[lr]::
41088::$$$message_0275_0057_0002$$$::"You can't apologize straight off the bat.[lr]::
41089::$$$message_0275_0057_0003$$$::So, what do you think, Shirou?"::
41090::$$$message_0275_0058_0000$$$::"I-I mean. Just how I can only say that delicious things taste good[line len=2]ugh[line len=2]I can't say it well, but it looks good on you! It looks so good on you that it's too good!"[lr]::
41091::$$$message_0275_0058_0001$$$::"That's an interesting expression. Are you saying I'm too good for this swimsuit? Or this swimsuit is too good for me?"[lr]::
41092::$$$message_0275_0058_0002$$$::"I-i-idiot! Obviously, you're too good for me!"::
41093::$$$message_0275_0059_0000$$$::"Thank you. But that's not true, Emiya. You're fine enough too.[lr]::
41094::$$$message_0275_0059_0001$$$::Let's see... If I were to give you a compliment like a girl, I would say you have a healthy appeal."[lr]::
41095::$$$message_0275_0059_0002$$$::She giggles joyfully.[lr]::
41096::$$$message_0275_0059_0003$$$::B-but what is a healthy appeal...?::
41097::$$$message_0275_0060_0000$$$::"W-well, I do work out.[lr]::
41098::$$$message_0275_0060_0001$$$::...But if I'm to be your partner, I'd prefer height over muscles."[lr]::
41099::$$$message_0275_0060_0002$$$::If I were five centimeters taller, then Tohsaka could walk with her head held high.::
41100::$$$message_0275_0061_0000$$$::"That's okay, I'll be looking forward to your growth in the future, too. [cacheimage storage=凛fd特殊01d頬(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛fd特殊01d頬(中) textoff=0]...Thanks, Shirou."[lr]::
41101::$$$message_0275_0061_0001$$$::"Hm? Why are you thanking me?"[lr]::
41102::$$$message_0275_0061_0002$$$::"Don't worry about it, it's a secret.[lr]::
41103::$$$message_0275_0061_0003$$$::A-all right, our negotiation is complete! Brace yourself, we're going to have a ton of fun!"::
41104::$$$message_0275_0062_0000$$$::...So...[lr]::
41105::$$$message_0275_0062_0001$$$::About everyone's princess who has completely returned to normal...::
41106::$$$message_0275_0063_0000$$$::...[lr]::
41107::$$$message_0275_0063_0001$$$::It's summer.[lr]::
41108::$$$message_0275_0063_0002$$$::It's undeniably summer, even if it's October.[lr]::
41109::$$$message_0275_0063_0003$$$::The indoor water resort, which is unaffected by weather, is fully displaying its power, and just this venue is full of midsummer vibes.[lr]::
41110::$$$message_0275_0063_0004$$$::There's tropical juice on the tray in my hand.[lr]::
41111::$$$message_0275_0063_0005$$$::Tohsaka is...::
41112::$$$message_0275_0064_0000$$$::"Hehe, I kinda feel like I'm in some paradise."[lr]::
41113::$$$message_0275_0064_0001$$$::She is floating, carefree.::
41114::$$$message_0275_0065_0000$$$::"What's wrong, Emiya? You look conflicted."[lr]::
41115::$$$message_0275_0065_0001$$$::"...Nothing. This was our promise."::
41116::$$$message_0275_0066_0000$$$::In exchange for Tohsaka relaxing, I'm pretending to be a servant next to her.[lr]::
41117::$$$message_0275_0066_0001$$$::I must look awfully weird holding a tray in one hand to the others who are in a leisurely mood.[lr]::
41118::$$$message_0275_0066_0002$$$::I'm supposed to obey her every command, so this is within a tolerable range, but... Once I collect myself, I get sad wondering what I'm doing in this neighborhood pool that I can get to by bus.::
41119::$$$message_0275_0067_0000$$$::"Hmm, this is nice... It was gloomy and depressing over there."[lr]::
41120::$$$message_0275_0067_0001$$$::"By 'over there,' you mean England?"[lr]::
41121::$$$message_0275_0067_0002$$$::"Yeah, London fog... It's romantic, but it's basically cold and miserable moisture.[lr]::
41122::$$$message_0275_0067_0003$$$::Maybe it would be better in Paris, the City of Flowers. If that's hard, then somewhere with hot springs."::
41123::$$$message_0275_0068_0000$$$::"What? Paris aside, wouldn't it not be very tasteful for a mage to be living in like...hot springs resorts like Beppu or Kusatsu?"[lr]::
41124::$$$message_0275_0068_0001$$$::"It's like how there were many writers living in Kamakura. Although that's mostly my grandfather's generation."::
41125::$$$message_0275_0069_0000$$$::How long ago were writers living in Kamakura?[lr]::
41126::$$$message_0275_0069_0001$$$::I don't know much about other mages in this country other than Kiritsugu, Tohsaka, or Matou, so this is my first time hearing about it.::
41127::$$$message_0275_0070_0000$$$::"Anyway, once you experience the lack of sunshine over there, you'll want to go on vacation.[lr]::
41128::$$$message_0275_0070_0001$$$::Mm, summer is nice. It makes me feel so much better just by relaxing like this."::
41129::$$$message_0275_0071_0000$$$::Tohsaka says this...[lr]::
41130::$$$message_0275_0071_0001$$$::...all while she floats. She looks like she's enjoying herself.[lr]::
41131::$$$message_0275_0071_0002$$$::The water is warm, smooth, and the rhythm of the waves feels good.[lr]::
41132::$$$message_0275_0071_0003$$$::Granted, I'm only standing by the pool.::
41133::$$$message_0275_0072_0000$$$::"Ahh... Mm, Shirou?"[lr]::
41134::$$$message_0275_0072_0001$$$::"What? Are you going to start paddling out to sea?"[lr]::
41135::$$$message_0275_0072_0002$$$::"No... I was thinking that we could go over there together."::
41136::$$$message_0275_0073_0000$$$::"Coming back here during break is good too, but let's go to the other side of the ocean together."[lr]::
41137::$$$message_0275_0073_0001$$$::"The ocean, huh... Does England have beaches where we can swim?"[lr]::
41138::$$$message_0275_0073_0002$$$::"It does, but it's not fun since it's full of sandy beaches for sunbathing.[lr]::
41139::$$$message_0275_0073_0003$$$::If we were to go, Southern France, the French Riviera, around the Aegean Sea, or the Mediterranean Sea would be great." ::
41140::$$$message_0275_0074_0000$$$::Tohsaka sounds relaxed.[lr]::
41141::$$$message_0275_0074_0001$$$::...A vacation by the Mediterranean Sea, huh... It's cliché, but I can only think of a turquoise ocean and white coast.[lr]::
41142::$$$message_0275_0074_0002$$$::A sea resort with just the two of us... No, that's even harder to imagine.::
41143::$$$message_0275_0075_0000$$$::"That's pretty legit... What's the Mediterranean Sea like?"[lr]::
41144::$$$message_0275_0075_0001$$$::"I'm sure it's like paradise."[lr]::
41145::$$$message_0275_0075_0002$$$::"A paradise...? Yes, perhaps it used to be.[lr]::
41146::$$$message_0275_0075_0003$$$::I am also knowledgeable about that area. Are you referring to Crete, Milos, Paros, and Naxos?"[lr]::
41147::$$$message_0275_0075_0004$$$::Wait. What is this answer that oddly seems to be speaking from experience?::
41148::$$$message_0275_0076_0000$$$::"Woah! Why!?"[lr]::
41149::$$$message_0275_0076_0001$$$::When I look back, there is an eye-popping beauty.[lr]::
41150::$$$message_0275_0076_0002$$$::She's in a swimsuit and doesn't have glasses on, but she is...::
41151::$$$message_0275_0077_0000$$$::"...Rider!?"[lr]::
41152::$$$message_0275_0077_0001$$$::"Hello, Shirou, Rin.[lr]::
41153::$$$message_0275_0077_0002$$$::Fancy meeting you two here."::
41154::$$$message_0275_0078_0000$$$::Rider is smiling in a swimsuit... Am I dreaming again?[lr]::
41155::$$$message_0275_0078_0001$$$::And she doesn't have glasses on. Yet, there isn't a mountain of stone statues all around.::
41156::$$$message_0275_0079_0000$$$::"Rider, you...don't have glasses on. Why are you here?"[lr]::
41157::$$$message_0275_0079_0001$$$::"Well, I simply came here to relax. Just like you two."::
41158::$$$message_0275_0080_0000$$$::Wow. I didn't know Rider, who's always reading books whenever she's free, had time to hang at the pool.::
41159::$$$message_0275_0081_0000$$$::"...I did not intend to disturb you two, but you seemed to be talking about my hometown, so I couldn't help but chime in."[lr]::
41160::$$$message_0275_0081_0001$$$::"Well, yeah... But still."::
41161::$$$message_0275_0082_0000$$$::I look at Rider's swimsuit without being obvious. My mind was about to explode when I saw Tohsaka's too, but Rider is also neck and neck with her.[lr]::
41162::$$$message_0275_0082_0001$$$::Or rather, their intentions are different.[lr]::
41163::$$$message_0275_0082_0002$$$::The way she's hiding her full proportions as a mature woman with such little fabric is like a crime.::
41164::$$$message_0275_0083_0000$$$::"Is there something weird about me?"[lr]::
41165::$$$message_0275_0083_0001$$$::"No, nothing at all, you're completely...perfect."[lr]::
41166::$$$message_0275_0083_0002$$$::She's so perfect that she has as much impact as a one-ton punch.::
41167::$$$message_0275_0084_0000$$$::"I see. I have gained confidence from your compliment."[lr]::
41168::$$$message_0275_0084_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
41169::$$$message_0275_0084_0002$$$::Minus the fact that it's about her swimsuit, it's rare to see Rider smiling like this.[lr]::
41170::$$$message_0275_0084_0003$$$::It's only natural that I would forget the situation and admire her...::
41171::$$$message_0275_0085_0000$$$::"Wait, more importantly...[lr]::
41172::$$$message_0275_0085_0001$$$::Rider, are you alone today?"[lr]::
41173::$$$message_0275_0085_0002$$$::"Yes, I just came to let my hair down.[lr]::
41174::$$$message_0275_0085_0003$$$::Coming to follow and monitor you two...sounds fun, but unfortunately, this is a complete coincidence."::
41175::$$$message_0275_0086_0000$$$::Following us...? There's only one person who could ask Rider to do that, hahaha.::
41176::$$$message_0275_0087_0000$$$::"Now, I must be in the way, so I will go swim over there.[lr]::
41177::$$$message_0275_0087_0001$$$::You two [wvl][se storage=se552.wav]please take your time...if you want to know about the Aegean Sea, I will be happy to talk about it later."::
41178::$$$message_0275_0088_0000$$$::She then disappears into the water without making a single wave and goes off into the distance, swimming underwater... The way she swims is oddly inhuman, but it makes sense if it's Rider.[lr]::
41179::$$$message_0275_0088_0001$$$::I stare in the direction where Rider went... Oh, she's not coming up to the surface. She disappeared into the water like a water snake.::
41180::$$$message_0275_0089_0000$$$::"...Hey, Emiya?"[lr]::
41181::$$$message_0275_0089_0001$$$::Huh?[lr]::
41182::$$$message_0275_0089_0002$$$::Tohsaka is mad, while floating on a swim ring.::
41183::$$$message_0275_0090_0000$$$::"Well, Rider was just here."[lr]::
41184::$$$message_0275_0090_0001$$$::"Yeah, I was surprised too. I didn't think that we would actually run into an acquaintance here."[lr]::
41185::$$$message_0275_0090_0002$$$::"Yeah, Rider was quite something. She didn't have her glasses on, but I wonder what she's doing about her Mystic Eyes that can turn people into stone."::
41186::$$$message_0275_0091_0000$$$::"Oh, that's no problem.[lr]::
41187::$$$message_0275_0091_0001$$$::I tried making hard contact lenses for a fitting session... Wait, that's not important right now."::
41188::$$$message_0275_0092_0000$$$::"Emiya, you seemed to be real quick to ogle her."[lr]::
41189::$$$message_0275_0092_0001$$$::"...Oof."[lr]::
41190::$$$message_0275_0092_0002$$$::She's so damn observant[line len=2]no[line len=2]cautious.[lr]::
41191::$$$message_0275_0092_0003$$$::It's like she knows exactly what her butler is doing behind her.::
41192::$$$message_0275_0093_0000$$$::"Yeah, I also thought Rider was quite something. Ugh, I don't know if I'm shocked or jealous."[lr]::
41193::$$$message_0275_0093_0001$$$::"...Oui. I am glad that you understand."[lr]::
41194::$$$message_0275_0093_0002$$$::I am in absolute obedience mode, so I can't help but make an excuse in a butler-like tone.::
41195::$$$message_0275_0094_0000$$$::"Mhm... So, which part of Rider did you look at first?"[lr]::
41196::$$$message_0275_0094_0001$$$::"...Hm. What do you mean by, 'which part'?"::
41197::$$$message_0275_0095_0000$$$::I panic over my master[line len=2]I mean[line len=2]Tohsaka's merciless interrogation.[lr]::
41198::$$$message_0275_0095_0001$$$::By asking where I looked first, she's probably trying to ask which part I was admiring.[lr]::
41199::$$$message_0275_0095_0002$$$::...That's quite a hard question.::
41200::$$$message_0275_0096_0000$$$::"Well, I was just curious if I was looking at the same place as you."[lr]::
41201::$$$message_0275_0096_0001$$$::"...That is, you know..."[lr]::
41202::$$$message_0275_0096_0002$$$::Even if I lie, she'll probably find out.[lr]::
41203::$$$message_0275_0096_0003$$$::And it's a natural action as a guy.[lr]::
41204::$$$message_0275_0096_0004$$$::The part I looked at first was...::
41205::$$$message_0275_0097_0000$$$::"...Your face is red, Emiya."[lr]::
41206::$$$message_0275_0097_0001$$$::"Of course I'd blush. First of all, you know..."[lr]::
41207::$$$message_0275_0097_0002$$$::The pool is that kind of place.[lr]::
41208::$$$message_0275_0097_0003$$$::It would be rude not to admire women's bodies!::
41209::$$$message_0275_0098_0000$$$::"Oh, you actually answered honestly. Good boy."[lr]::
41210::$$$message_0275_0098_0001$$$::"I am grateful to have received such a compliment... Wait, what about you?"[lr]::
41211::$$$message_0275_0098_0002$$$::"...I guess I'm the same as you."[lr]::
41212::$$$message_0275_0098_0003$$$::Tohsaka flutters her legs.[lr]::
41213::$$$message_0275_0098_0004$$$::Is she...sulking?::
41214::$$$message_0275_0099_0000$$$::"When it's that plentiful, I can't help but feel defeat. Besides, Rider as a whole is...you know?"[lr]::
41215::$$$message_0275_0099_0001$$$::A completely perfect body where everything curves inwards and outwards in all the right places... Oh, it's like how I get jealous about how tall Archer or Lancer is.::
41216::$$$message_0275_0100_0000$$$::"Even though I gave it my all so that I could take your breath away.[lr]::
41217::$$$message_0275_0100_0001$$$::Well, it can't be helped if it's Rider. It seems like something bad always happens when it matters most."[lr]::
41218::$$$message_0275_0100_0002$$$::Tohsaka sighs.::
41219::$$$message_0275_0101_0000$$$::"Really? If I had to choose who is better, I'd say you're cuter."[lr]::
41220::$$$message_0275_0101_0001$$$::I try to get her to agree with me.::
41221::$$$message_0275_0102_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
41222::$$$message_0275_0102_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
41223::$$$message_0275_0102_0002$$$::...S-shoot.[lr]::
41224::$$$message_0275_0102_0003$$$::I may have just blurted that out, but even I blush from how direct it was.::
41225::$$$message_0275_0103_0000$$$::"...Oh... Um, Tohsaka."[lr]::
41226::$$$message_0275_0103_0001$$$::I call to her, unable to stand the silence.[lr]::
41227::$$$message_0275_0103_0002$$$::I-it is my duty as a butler to give a lending hand to my master when she's at a loss.::
41228::$$$message_0275_0104_0000$$$::"Rider was pretty of course, but not as pretty as when I first saw you in your swimsuit."[lr]::
41229::$$$message_0275_0104_0001$$$::"...Flattery is unlike you."[lr]::
41230::$$$message_0275_0104_0002$$$::"It's not flattery. You know I'm no good at that sort of thing."[lr]::
41231::$$$message_0275_0104_0003$$$::Yeah. Even if I'm clumsy, I know when I need to explain myself.::
41232::$$$message_0275_0105_0000$$$::"See, no matter how pretty Rider looks in her swimsuit, it doesn't feel real even if I look at her; I'm just blown away.[lr]::
41233::$$$message_0275_0105_0001$$$::...Well, you know. No offense to Rider, but it's like seeing Mount Fuji or Niagara Falls."::
41234::$$$message_0275_0106_0000$$$::"...Yeah. I kinda get what you're saying."[lr]::
41235::$$$message_0275_0106_0001$$$::"Right? But, I was genuinely happy when I saw you.[lr]::
41236::$$$message_0275_0106_0002$$$::It's not about who beats who in terms of boobs or figure or whatever, but it's so like you that I can't express it well..."[lr]::
41237::$$$message_0275_0106_0003$$$::I stir around the water that's up to my hips in frustration.[lr]::
41238::$$$message_0275_0106_0004$$$::Tohsaka is watching over me while floating.::
41239::$$$message_0275_0107_0000$$$::"...To put it bluntly, I realized how aroused I was getting from looking at you."[lr]::
41240::$$$message_0275_0107_0001$$$::"...Hey, what are you saying in a place like this...!?"[lr]::
41241::$$$message_0275_0107_0002$$$::I-I'm also embarrassed, so I would like for her to endure it! Wait, why am I getting so serious explaining myself!?::
41242::$$$message_0275_0108_0000$$$::"I-I don't mean it exactly like that.[lr]::
41243::$$$message_0275_0108_0001$$$::Anyway, you're attractive enough, and I'm nervous even now, so don't mind Rider![lr]::
41244::$$$message_0275_0108_0002$$$::Also, time is passing by too fast today! It'll be the afternoon before we know it!"[lr]::
41245::$$$message_0275_0108_0003$$$::"..."::
41246::$$$message_0275_0109_0000$$$::Oof, I can't stop myself![lr]::
41247::$$$message_0275_0109_0001$$$::I'm so embarrassed that I want to just carry Tohsaka in her swim ring and take her somewhere else...![lr]::
41248::$$$message_0275_0109_0002$$$::"Hrrk, wait, I'll calm down, I'll calm down right away."[lr]::
41249::$$$message_0275_0109_0003$$$::I've failed as a butler.[lr]::
41250::$$$message_0275_0109_0004$$$::I take two deep breaths.::
41251::$$$message_0275_0110_0000$$$::"...Those are all my true feelings as a butler.[lr]::
41252::$$$message_0275_0110_0001$$$::That's how it is for me, so I don't have any issues with completely obeying you. It's fun."::
41253::$$$message_0275_0111_0000$$$::I'll serve those who want me.[lr]::
41254::$$$message_0275_0111_0001$$$::It's like being filled with a faint, yet pleasant feeling of superiority.[lr]::
41255::$$$message_0275_0111_0002$$$::I feel like I said something rather embarrassing out loud, but I clear my throat once and go back to standing upright.::
41256::$$$message_0275_0112_0000$$$::"Tohsaka...?"[lr]::
41257::$$$message_0275_0112_0001$$$::"...Ugh. I can't just leave you behind and go somewhere else now."[lr]::
41258::$$$message_0275_0112_0002$$$::Tohsaka, who muttered something strange, gets up and out of the swim ring.::
41259::$$$message_0275_0113_0000$$$::"I said that you're still a handful.[lr]::
41260::$$$message_0275_0113_0001$$$::...Well, although I'm the one at fault."::
41261::$$$message_0275_0114_0000$$$::Tohsaka shrugs her shoulders.[lr]::
41262::$$$message_0275_0114_0001$$$::That wasn't directed towards me, but was more like her way of self-reflecting.[lr]::
41263::$$$message_0275_0114_0002$$$::...Then...[lr]::
41264::$$$message_0275_0114_0003$$$::"T-Tohsaka!?"[lr]::
41265::$$$message_0275_0114_0004$$$::"It's fine, we're at the pool. This much is normal."::
41266::$$$message_0275_0115_0000$$$::"Hnng...!"[lr]::
41267::$$$message_0275_0115_0001$$$::W-was she even listening!? I just confessed that I'm aroused even now!::
41268::$$$message_0275_0116_0000$$$::"Oh, your heart rate has gone up. You really were enduring it."[lr]::
41269::$$$message_0275_0116_0001$$$::"I-I've been telling you so! So please distance yourself from me already."::
41270::$$$message_0275_0117_0000$$$::"No thanks. Also, that just reconfirmed something.[lr]::
41271::$$$message_0275_0117_0001$$$::You're still inexperienced, so being that busybody is my job.[lr]::
41272::$$$message_0275_0117_0002$$$::This is my calling that Rider or Saber can't get in the way of."::
41273::$$$message_0275_0118_0000$$$::She smiles.[lr]::
41274::$$$message_0275_0118_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
41275::$$$message_0275_0118_0002$$$::...To be honest, I even admired that smile from the bottom of my heart.::
41276::$$$message_0275_0119_0000$$$::"...Heh. I am sorry for being inexperienced."[lr]::
41277::$$$message_0275_0119_0001$$$::I grumble, in a butler-like tone.[lr]::
41278::$$$message_0275_0119_0002$$$::"Yes. If it bothers you that much, then grow into a fine man that would panic if I get taken. I'll be looking forward to that day, my butler."::
41279::$$$message_0275_0120_0000$$$::Is this also another step towards absolute obedience?[lr]::
41280::$$$message_0275_0120_0001$$$::...But becoming a full-fledged mage aside, a fine man, huh...? I don't even have the slightest idea at all. This pool date might've been rather costly after all.::
41281::$$$message_0275_0121_0000$$$::"Now, enough about the future. Let's enjoy the pool today.[lr]::
41282::$$$message_0275_0121_0001$$$::Come here, they have a water slide over there. Let's do that first and then... Wow, they even have beach volleyball! Let's grab Rider and play volleyball! Wahoo!"::
41283::$$$message_0275_0122_0000$$$::Tohsaka starts running around excitedly.[lr]::
41284::$$$message_0275_0122_0001$$$::"Okay, okay. I shall keep you company of course."[lr]::
41285::$$$message_0275_0122_0002$$$::I have no way of defying her as a butler.[lr]::
41286::$$$message_0275_0122_0003$$$::I'll also have fun with all my might.[lr]::
41287::$$$message_0275_0122_0004$$$::There's about five hours left until closing.[lr]::
41288::$$$message_0275_0122_0005$$$::I bet the afternoon will also pass by in a flash just like the morning.::
41289::$$$message_0275_0123_0000$$$::"Man, I had fun."[lr]::
41290::$$$message_0275_0123_0001$$$::"...Are you satisfied, Tohsaka?"::
41291::$$$message_0275_0124_0000$$$::I continued doing things that are more reckless than the assignments that Tohsaka gave me.[lr]::
41292::$$$message_0275_0124_0001$$$::In the end, I even played beach volleyball with some muscular guys that I've seen before.[lr]::
41293::$$$message_0275_0124_0002$$$::She told me to help her win... But even with her asking me to do that, it felt like our opponents weren't human.::
41294::$$$message_0275_0125_0000$$$::"...You were playing rather seriously too."[lr]::
41295::$$$message_0275_0125_0001$$$::"It's my family motto to never hold back when it comes to competitions. But we didn't have enough height."::
41296::$$$message_0275_0126_0000$$$::...The only people who could beat those two in height would be Mr. Kuzuki and Father Kotomine.[lr]::
41297::$$$message_0275_0126_0001$$$::Tohsaka, who made up for our lack of height with her athleticism, rolled around in a bikini and made the crowd go wild.[lr]::
41298::$$$message_0275_0126_0002$$$::It's like we lost the match but won the game.::
41299::$$$message_0275_0127_0000$$$::"Ahh... Oh yeah, Tohsaka."[lr]::
41300::$$$message_0275_0127_0001$$$::"What happened? Do you have plans to go buy something from the shopping district?"[lr]::
41301::$$$message_0275_0127_0002$$$::"No, the time limit of my absolute obedience. What are you gonna do?"::
41302::$$$message_0275_0128_0000$$$::We agreed that the deal would last the whole day.[lr]::
41303::$$$message_0275_0128_0001$$$::We came back from the pool, and Tohsaka changed into her regular clothes ages ago.[lr]::
41304::$$$message_0275_0128_0002$$$::But since we've already left, it wouldn't be weird for us to decide that the time limit has already passed.::
41305::$$$message_0275_0129_0000$$$::"...Do you want to continue?"[lr]::
41306::$$$message_0275_0129_0001$$$::Absolute obedience for the entire day.[lr]::
41307::$$$message_0275_0129_0002$$$::If it's literally how it sounds, then we can continue until midnight.[lr]::
41308::$$$message_0275_0129_0003$$$::Besides, I feel like I never want it to end.::
41309::$$$message_0275_0130_0000$$$::"Then, the contract is complete. Is that okay?"[lr]::
41310::$$$message_0275_0130_0001$$$::Tohsaka declares brilliantly, as if getting rid of her regrets.[lr]::
41311::$$$message_0275_0130_0002$$$::Yeah, I can agree to that.::
41312::$$$message_0275_0131_0000$$$::"All right, I shall devote myself to you as long as your rebellious phase continues."[lr]::
41313::$$$message_0275_0131_0001$$$::"You're around that age too, you know. All right, I shall listen to any of your worries as your teacher."[lr]::
41314::$$$message_0275_0131_0002$$$::"Nothing is different...after all."::
41315::$$$message_0275_0132_0000$$$::"We're home."[lr]::
41316::$$$message_0275_0132_0001$$$::"We're back, I'm so tired."[lr]::
41317::$$$message_0275_0132_0002$$$::"Oh, we forgot about souvenirs. [cacheimage storage=凛私服08d(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服08d(中) textoff=0]Even though they had macadamia nuts and Hawaiian steamed buns."[lr]::
41318::$$$message_0275_0132_0003$$$::"Oh yeah. Then that'll be for next time."::
941112::$$$message_9275_0064_0000$$$::"Hehe, I kinda feel like I'm in some paradise."[r]::
�